1-year return by how far the strategy was below its high on the start day; steady set-up, six close times pooled

start                        |  2018-21: starts  median 1y  P(loss) |  2022-25: starts  median 1y  P(loss)
at/near a high (<2% below)   |            2842      +20.9%       8% |             576      +15.7%      22% |
2-5% below                   |            1377      +20.3%      19% |             923      +14.6%      28% |
5-10% below                  |            3564      +35.4%      11% |            3553       +3.7%      32% |
>10% below                   |             589      +24.8%       0% |            3291      +11.6%      30% |

verdict: the start timing does not matter in a useful way
